{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo figure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon &amp; item variety is currently limited.(Only partial types can be used in this version).\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon tags not effecting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currencies accumulation not available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-pilot system not available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One battle-map available.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the rogue-lite game <strong>Crispy Kart</strong>, you play as a cookie dreaming of becoming a pro racer. To join the racing league, you must gather experience, collect materials, and defeat the shadowy saboteur disrupting the races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your kart and collected weapons to crush waves of enemy motorized vehicles and mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionGif_01.gif?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ram, shoot, bomb, loot, upgrade! This is your core combat loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just remember\u2014your battle kart is made entirely of\u2026 desserts and baked goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_02_en.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_09.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique weapons and items</strong> to choose from (Lollipop Wrecking Ball, Popcorn Shotgun, and more).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_04_en.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both you and enemy vehicles have drivers who escape when their vehicles are destroyed. Eliminate enemy drivers for bonus materials. If your own driver escapes... RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit eccentric cookie co-pilots: Normally helpful allies, but... you'll never predict their next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_10.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_13_en.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast through block walls! All walls are edible and destructible. Destroying them often drops crucial materials for permanent progression. You can also dash through them invincibly - though save your dash for combat emergencies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random power-up panels appear on roads. Drive over them for temporary boosts to dominate battles - your key to reversing tough situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionGif_02.gif?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_12_en.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue-lite mechanics let you collect materials/currency during runs to permanently upgrade your kart for previously impossible challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cross-enhance your kart through weapon/equipment synergies. Transform it into an indestructible mobile fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_06_en.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_11.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rev up your customized kart...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/extras/AboutSectionImage_14_en.png?t=1751695044\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833060?t=1751695044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/647388a5d68ec12e3a428b0d252995d19f83d13d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751695044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/efc2eb468ffd83cfa8d6108ba67aa91f2e4f9a13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751695044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833060/efc2eb468ffd83cfa8d6108ba67aa91f2e4f9a13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751695044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo figure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon &amp; item variety is currently limited.(Only partial types can be use